# ── Query ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@When "^maker retrieves online fixings for the trade$"
    When get '/trades/{id}/fixings/online' with path parameter 'id' from stored variable 'createdTradeId' as user 'maker@example.com'
    And attach the response body to the report

@Given "^fixing data is prepared$"
    When maker retrieves online fixings for the trade
    Then response status code is '200'

# ── Assertions ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@Then "^online fixings are returned successfully$"
    Then response status code is '200'
    And response matches current scenario
    And response body contains a non-empty value at key 'data.fixings.values()[0][0].value'
